{
  "title": { "zh": "生成器遇上任取" },
  "builds": "elimGen",
  "adds": ["anyR", "swapConcl", "consFront", "mkRule", "eachOf", "keepBound"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "板上是你当前的<part-ref to=\"lemma:elimGen\"></part-ref>。<level-ref to=\"decl-ex\"></level-ref>的引入规则 ⋀x. ⟦?P(x)⟧ ⟹ ∃y. ?P(y) 先任取一样东西 x：在生成器里，它是约束了 x 的规则，不是一条普通的规则，「替换结论」不接受它。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新元件「保留⋀」是一个框：规则以约束变量开头时，框里处理其后的规则，输出时在前面放回同样的约束变量；没有约束变量时，框里直接处理输入。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:exE\"></part-ref>要给那样东西起一个新名字，原因就在这里。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "gen-ex",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "elim",
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "it", "label": { "zh": "它" } },
        { "name": "ways", "label": { "zh": "引入规则（一串）" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        { "it": "?A ∧ ?B", "ways": ["⟦?A; ?B⟧ ⟹ ?A ∧ ?B"], "elim": ["?A ∧ ?B", "⟦?A; ?B⟧ ⟹ ?R"] },
        { "it": "?A ∨ ?B", "ways": ["⟦?A⟧ ⟹ ?A ∨ ?B", "⟦?B⟧ ⟹ ?A ∨ ?B"], "elim": ["?A ∨ ?B", "⟦?A⟧ ⟹ ?R", "⟦?B⟧ ⟹ ?R"] },
        { "it": "⊥", "ways": [], "elim": ["⊥"] },
        { "it": "?A ↔ ?B", "ways": ["⟦?A → ?B; ?B → ?A⟧ ⟹ ?A ↔ ?B"], "elim": ["?A ↔ ?B", "⟦?A → ?B; ?B → ?A⟧ ⟹ ?R"] },
        { "it": "∃y. ?P(y)", "ways": ["⋀x. ⟦?P(x)⟧ ⟹ ∃y. ?P(y)"], "elim": ["∃y. ?P(y)", "⋀x. ⟦?P(x)⟧ ⟹ ?R"] }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "it": "∃u. ∃v. ?P(u, v)",
          "ways": ["⋀x y. ⟦?P(x, y)⟧ ⟹ ∃u. ∃v. ?P(u, v)"],
          "elim": ["∃u. ∃v. ?P(u, v)", "⋀x y. ⟦?P(x, y)⟧ ⟹ ?R"]
        }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "升级消去规则生成器，使引入规则带约束变量时也能生成消去规则。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "比一比「存在」的引入规则和要生成的那种情况：哪一部分没有变？"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "r = anyR()",
        "e = eachOf(ways, body: a) {",
        "  body {",
        "    a = keepBound(e.body, body: s) {",
        "      body {",
        "        s = swapConcl(a.body, r)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "c = consFront(it, e)",
        "m = mkRule(c, r)",
        "out <- m"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "r = anyR()",
        "e = eachOf(ways, body: s) {",
        "  body {",
        "    s = swapConcl(e.body, r)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "c = consFront(it, e)",
        "m = mkRule(c, r)",
        "out <- m"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
